<title>GERMANY: Siemens sees higher Nixdorf sales, profit.</title>
<headline>Siemens sees higher Nixdorf sales, profit.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German electonics and engineering giant Siemens AG said on Thursday it expects sales and profit to rise this year at its Siemens Nixdorf computers unit.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects its 1996/97 dividend to remain stable at 1.50 marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
